  <slide>
    <title>Skeletal notes: fill it in during class, read it complete after</title>
    <ol>
      <li><p><alert>Before class.</alert> Students open or print the skeletal notes: definitions and set-ups are there, the work is left blank.</p></li>
      <li><p><alert>In class.</alert> We do the derivations together and students write in the workspace boxes.</p></li>
